     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Normalize keratinocyte proliferation and differentiation; used alone or with topical corticosteroids, and the combination works better than either alone (SORT A). Some clinicians use calcipotriol on weekdays and the steroid on weekends"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
     "indRight": 0,
